{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1529107200, "end_date": 1529798399, "month_true_total": 73, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:51:08 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42968597", "author": {"steamid": "76561198208260053", "personaname": "黄忠", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198208260053/", "num_games_owned": 318, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 124627, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2547, "last_played": 1781877560, "avatar": "5acbd07d5383f846c8877313ba2449eeeb1a5ce3"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "如果你已经很久没有玩到过让你兴奋沉迷的游戏，那就赶快买吧。从几年前到现在玩STEAM的第一次留言，刚下载就一口气玩了10个小时以上，很久没有玩到这么有意思耐玩的游戏了，希望官方以后能加入更多的 怪物种类（更大的怪物或BOSS级的怪物，无味屌虫这样的）、场景、职业、互动玩法，任务种类，比如生存模式，可以打怪或者收集能源补给一直生存，生存时间越久奖励越高等\n\nI download this game for 36 hours and I played for 28 hours lol（12 hours for sleep, in 2 days), I m addicted to this game now,  and I let all my friends bought this game too. they love it. \n\nPlease add more dwarf characters( something like sniper, healer and more creative dwarf) add more bugs, just like the big red one, add something like epic bugs, the giant mother bug, which can give birth to small worms, and spit things to you, some huge bugs that would be awesome. Also, add more maps( like snow iceberg tundra) more play style, more mode and campaigns. I'm currently lv 16, I feel like it will not be so fun if I get to lv20.\n\nI can see the bright future of this game, I totally support this game!!! ❤❤❤\nLove from China.", "timestamp_created": 1529761212, "timestamp_updated": 1529815243, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.532667458057403564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reac